$ rgit scrub --drop-backup
Dropped the scrub backup (2 refs) and the undo history (it keeps old commits too).
The old commits can now go: `rgit reflog expire --expire=now --all`, `rgit gc --prune=now` (loose objects)
and `rgit repack -a -d` (packed ones).
